source: src/app.rs
expression: main
---
<h1>Compare runs</h1><h2>Training performance</h2><p>Value summary: latest of retained reported samples. Mean is arithmetic, not time-weighted or a recomputed whole-run throughput. Step durations are converted from seconds to milliseconds. Not reported means no valid value was found in retained history.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Training performance" tabindex="0"><table id="training-performance"><tr><th>Run</th><th>Mean ms/step</th><th>Max ms/step</th><th>Tokens/sec</th></tr><tr><td class="run-name">a/same</td><td>Not reported</td><td>Not reported</td><td>Not reported</td></tr><tr><td class="run-name">b/same</td><td>Not reported</td><td>Not reported</td><td>Not reported</td></tr></table></div><table><tr><th>Run</th><th>State</th><th>Step</th><th>Latest metrics</th><th>Benchmarks</th><th>Trainer time</th></tr><tr><td>a/same</td><td>running</td><td>2</td><td>loss: 1</td><td>latency: 1 ms</td><td>20s (last logged)</td></tr><tr><td>b/same</td><td>running</td><td>2</td><td>loss: 2</td><td>latency: 2 ms</td><td>20s (last logged)</td></tr></table><div class="actions"><a href="#benchmarks">Benchmarks</a><a href="#comparison-metadata">Metadata differences</a></div><form id="chart-filters" class="filters"><input type="hidden" name="run" value="a/same"><input type="hidden" name="run" value="b/same"><fieldset><legend>Metrics and charts</legend><label>Filter metrics <input name="metric" list="metrics" autocomplete="off" placeholder="All metrics (e.g. loss)" value="loss"></label><datalist id="metrics"><option value="loss"></option><option value="custom"></option></datalist><label>Axis <select name="axis"><option value="auto" selected="">auto</option><option value="tokens">tokens</option><option value="flops">flops</option><option value="step">step</option><option value="seconds">seconds</option><option value="time">time</option></select></label><label>Value summary <select name="aggregate"><option value="latest" selected="">Latest</option><option value="mean">Mean</option><option value="min">Min</option><option value="max">Max</option></select></label><button>Apply</button></fieldset><details id="chart-options"><summary>Smoothing, range and seed groups</summary><fieldset><label>Smoothing method <select name="smoothing"><option value="auto" selected="">Auto (loss Gaussian)</option><option value="gaussian">Gaussian</option><option value="raw">Raw</option><option value="mean">Trailing mean</option><option value="ema">EMA</option></select></label><label>Mean / EMA span <input type="number" name="smooth" min="1" max="100" value="20"></label><label>Seed groups <input type="checkbox" name="group" value="1" checked=""></label><label>Gaussian bandwidth (% of run axis range) <input type="number" name="bandwidth" min="0.5" max="10" step="0.1" value="1"></label><label>From <input type="number" step="any" name="start" value=""></label><label>To <input type="number" step="any" name="end" value=""></label></fieldset><p class="dim">Auto shows loss against tokens seen when all runs have token history, with raw loss under a centered Gaussian overlay; other metrics use steps and raw values. Gaussian bandwidth is its standard deviation in axis distance (default 1% of each run's full retained axis range), not observation count. Both sides contribute; new data can revise the curve, and its relative bandwidth grows with the run's axis range. EMA uses alpha = 2 / (span + 1), seeded from the first observation; span 1 is raw. Tokens sums reported train/real_tokens windows only with complete history, or uses cumulative train/tokens_seen. FLOPs requires cumulative train/flops_total; it is not estimated. Table summaries are unchanged.</p></details><p class="dim">Search any reported metric by substring, ignoring case. Each page shows up to 32 metrics; Next metrics shows the rest. Loss, step timing and throughput appear first, then other metrics alphabetically within each group.</p></form><div class="actions metric-navigation"><span>1 matching metrics shown</span></div><h2>Metric values</h2><p class="dim">Value summary: latest in each metric's logged units. Search above or use Next metrics to browse every reported numeric metric in retained history. Missing samples are not filled or counted as zero.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Metric values" tabindex="0"><table id="metric-values"><tr><th>Metric</th><th>a/same</th><th>b/same</th></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="metric-name">loss</th><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr></table></div><figure data-key="loss%7Ca%2Fsame%7Cb%2Fsame"><figcaption>loss <span class="dim">· 1 to 4</span><span class="dim" data-chart-state=""></span></figcaption><div class="legend"><span style="color:hsl(79,65%,36%)">a/same (Gaussian): 1</span><span style="color:hsl(80,65%,36%)">b/same (Gaussian): 2</span></div><svg class="plot" role="img" width="984" height="252" viewBox="0 0 984 252" aria-label="loss by step"><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="196" y2="196" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="200" text-anchor="end">1</text><text data-x-tick="0" x="60" y="218" text-anchor="start">1</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="151" y2="151" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="155" text-anchor="end">1.75</text><text data-x-tick="0.25" x="285" y="218" text-anchor="middle">1.25</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="106" y2="106" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="110" text-anchor="end">2.5</text><text data-x-tick="0.5" x="510" y="218" text-anchor="middle">1.5</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="61" y2="61" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="65" text-anchor="end">3.25</text><text data-x-tick="0.75" x="735" y="218" text-anchor="middle">1.75</text><line data-grid="" x1="60" x2="960" y1="16" y2="16" stroke="#dce2eb"></line><text data-y-tick="" x="52" y="20" text-anchor="end">4</text><text data-x-tick="1" x="960" y="218" text-anchor="end">2</text><text data-axis-label="" x="510" y="244" text-anchor="middle">step</text><svg class="chart" x="60" y="16" width="900" height="180" viewBox="0 0 900 180" preserveAspectRatio="none" tabindex="0" aria-label="Chart samples: use left and right arrow keys to inspect" data-axis="step" data-low="1" data-high="2"><rect width="900" height="180" fill="transparent"></rect><polyline fill="none" stroke="hsl(79,65%,36%)" stroke-width="1" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" data-label="a/same (raw)" data-samples="[[1.0,4.0],[1.0,4.0],[2.0,1.0],[2.0,1.0]]" points="0.00,0.00 0.00,0.00 900.00,180.00 900.00,180.00 "></polyline><polyline fill="none" stroke="hsl(79,65%,36%)" stroke-width="2" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" data-label="a/same (Gaussian)" data-samples="[[1.0,4.0],[1.0,4.0],[2.0,1.0],[2.0,1.0]]" points="0.00,0.00 0.00,0.00 900.00,180.00 900.00,180.00 "></polyline><polyline fill="none" stroke="hsl(80,65%,36%)" stroke-width="1" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" data-label="b/same (raw)" data-samples="[[1.0,4.0],[1.0,4.0],[2.0,2.0],[2.0,2.0]]" points="0.00,0.00 0.00,0.00 900.00,120.00 900.00,120.00 "></polyline><polyline fill="none" stroke="hsl(80,65%,36%)" stroke-width="2" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" data-label="b/same (Gaussian)" data-samples="[[1.0,4.0],[1.0,4.0],[2.0,2.0],[2.0,2.0]]" points="0.00,0.00 0.00,0.00 900.00,120.00 900.00,120.00 "></polyline><line data-cursor="" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="180" stroke="#63738a" stroke-dasharray="3 3" visibility="hidden"></line></svg></svg><div class="actions"><span class="dim">Hover or use arrow keys for values · Ctrl/⌘ + scroll to zoom · drag to pan when zoomed</span><button type="button" data-zoom="0.8" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><button type="button" data-zoom="1.25" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button type="button" data-reset="">Reset zoom</button></div><output aria-live="off"></output></figure><table><tr><th>Seed group</th><th>Distinct seeds</th><th>Last shared x</th><th>Mean</th><th>Sample standard deviation</th><th>Standard error</th></tr></table><p>Aggregation uses distinct declared seeds at exactly shared x values; standard error assumes independent seeds.</p><details id="comparison-metadata"><summary>Metadata differences</summary><table><tr><th>Metadata</th><th>a/same</th><th>b/same</th></tr><tr><td>dataset</td><td>"demo"</td><td>"demo"</td></tr><tr><td>group</td><td>"trial"</td><td>"trial"</td></tr><tr><td>parameters.lr</td><td>0.01</td><td>0.01</td></tr><tr><td>revision</td><td>"abc"</td><td>"abc"</td></tr><tr><td>secret</td><td>"private-metadata"</td><td>"private-metadata"</td></tr><tr><td>seed</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>tags.0</td><td>"pilot"</td><td>"pilot"</td></tr><tr><td>task_id</td><td>7</td><td>7</td></tr></table></details><h2 id="benchmarks">Benchmark summary</h2><table><tr><th>Metric / unit</th><th>a/same</th><th>b/same</th></tr><tr><td>latency (ms, lower)</td><td class="">1 (Δ 0) </td><td class="warn">2 (Δ 1) </td></tr></table><div class="actions"><a href="/export?run=a%2Fsame&amp;run=b%2Fsame&amp;metric=loss&amp;group=1">Download CSV</a><a href="/report?run=a%2Fsame&amp;run=b%2Fsame&amp;metric=loss&amp;group=1">Download static report</a></div>
